@EasyCreditApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5052

### API — butuh header X-Api-Key
GET {{EasyCreditApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: easycredit-dev-api-key

### API — login, lalu pakai Bearer token
POST {{EasyCreditApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: easycredit-dev-api-key

{
  "email": "admin@mail.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### API — daftar pengajuan (butuh Bearer token)
GET {{EasyCreditApi_HostAddress}}/api/credit-applications
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: easycredit-dev-api-key
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Frontend MVC — jalankan di port 5200
GET http://localhost:5200/Auth/Login

### Frontend MVC — dashboard (butuh session login)
GET http://localhost:5200/

### Frontend MVC — customer
GET http://localhost:5200/Customers

### Frontend MVC — partial tabel customer (dipanggil jQuery AJAX)
GET http://localhost:5200/Customers/Rows?keyword=&page=1&size=10

### Frontend MVC — form tambah customer
GET http://localhost:5200/Customers/Create

### Frontend MVC — pengajuan
GET http://localhost:5200/CreditApplications